{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>ויבאה</b> is written defective and it equals 24, that He adorned her with 24 adornments and brought her to him. ויביאה — four times in the Masorah: ויביאה אל האדם · ויביאה יצחק האהלה · ויביאה אל עיר דוד · וישקוד ה' על הרעה ויביאה. That before he married Pharaoh's daughter he had a share among the supernal ones, and this parallels the first man who was banished from the supernal ones on account of Eve; and with Isaac it was the reverse, for she was in Sarah's place — so it is found in the Midrash."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:20.713978288Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}